.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt STAT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm stat
.Nd display file status
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar path ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility prints the K60
.Vt Stat
record for each
.Ar path :
inode, size, blocks, mode, link count, owner and group, and the access, modification and change
times.
Times are whole seconds since the Unix epoch.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ls 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
